BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 564.00 Tm (1. Windows Application Control Policy Blocking uvicorn.exe: Direct invocation of uvicorn.exe was blocked by Windows) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 552.50 Tm (Defender Application Control \(ResourceUnavailable\). We solved this by creating run_server.py, which resolves BASE_DIR,) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 541.00 Tm (sets the working directory, and invokes uvicorn.run\("app.main:app"\) directly through the trusted Python interpreter process.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 529.50 Tm (2. Windows Console cp1252 UnicodeEncodeError on Currency Symbols: Logging the Indian Rupee symbol \(INR  / \\u20b9\) to) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 518.00 Tm (standard output crashed on Windows cp1252 streams. We hardened setup_logger\(\) in app/core/logging_config.py with) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 506.50 Tm (sys.stdout.reconfigure\(encoding="utf-8", errors="replace"\) and standardized log formatting to INR for universal OS) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 495.00 Tm (compatibility.) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 483.50 Tm (3. Eliminating Client-Side Preset Coupling: In early iterations, submitting an invoice from the UI reused the preset PO's line) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 472.00 Tm (items rather than reading live DOM edits. We refactored the workbench to bind every line-item cell to live DOM inputs) Tj ET
BT /F1 9.20 Tf 0.150 0.200 0.280 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 460.50 Tm (\(collectLineItemsFromDOM\(\)\), enabling true dynamic 3-way reconciliation on any user-modified row.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.20 Tf 0.060 0.090 0.160 rg 1 0 0 1 38.00 431.00 Tm (Question 10: How would you scale FinDoc-AuditEngine for a Fortune 500 deployment processing 500,000 invoices per day?) Tj ET
